sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.35) Rephora Mobile Client
        participant App as Flutter App
    end

    box rgba(34, 66, 41, 0.35) Spring Boot Monolith
        participant API as GraphQL API
        participant Worker as Scheduled SQS Consumer
        participant Notify as NotifyFlashcardsReady
    end

    box rgba(90, 63, 30, 0.30) AWS Messaging
        participant SNS as SNS ai_questions
        participant SQS as SQS ai_questions_queue
    end

    box rgba(77, 57, 98, 0.30) AI Provider
        participant DeepSeek as DeepSeek API
    end

    box rgba(77, 57, 98, 0.22) DynamoDB
        participant DB as DynamoDB tables
    end

    box rgba(31, 67, 77, 0.22) Firebase
        participant FCM as Firebase FCM
    end

    rect rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.07)
        Note over App,DB: Fast request path: accept the generation job without waiting for the LLM
        App->>API: Generate quiz mutation
        API->>DB: jobs: create job with status PENDING
        API->>SNS: Publish ai_questions payload
        SNS->>SQS: Fan out raw message to durable queue
        API-->>App: Return jobId while job remains PENDING
    end

    rect rgba(224, 169, 109, 0.08)
        Note over SQS,DB: Background path: durable polling, generation, persistence, and status transition
        Worker->>SQS: Scheduled poll
        SQS-->>Worker: Generation request message
        Worker->>DB: jobs: mark job RUNNING
        Worker->>DB: questions: query existing quiz questions for canonical exclusion
        DB-->>Worker: Existing question text set
        Worker->>DeepSeek: Request structured JSON question generation
        DeepSeek-->>Worker: JSON response payload

        alt JSON parses and generated questions are valid
            Worker->>DB: questions: persist generated questions
            Worker->>DB: quizzes: update generation metadata
            Worker->>DB: jobs: mark job COMPLETED
            Worker->>Notify: Dispatch flashcards-ready event
            Notify->>FCM: Send data message with jobId and quizId
            FCM-->>App: Flashcards ready push notification
        else DeepSeek, parsing, validation, or persistence fails
            Worker->>DB: jobs: mark job FAILED with error detail
        end
    end
